      {
        "id": "E3",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Canadian organizations building generative AI applications on Amazon Bedrock often need the latest foundation models (FMs), such as OpenAI GPT-6.1, OpenAI GPT-6, and GPT-5.6, accessible from the Canadian AWS Regions.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/access-openai-gpt-models-on-amazon-bedrock-from-canada-with-cross-region-inference/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-20T16:42:53.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-22T15:10:54.379Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E4",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "With Amazon Bedrock cross-Region inference (CRIS), you can now access these models from Canada.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/access-openai-gpt-models-on-amazon-bedrock-from-canada-with-cross-region-inference/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-20T16:42:53.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-22T15:10:54.379Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E5",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "OpenAI GPT-5.6 models (Sol, Terra, and Luna), GPT-6 (Astra, Sol, and Luna), and GPT-6.1 Sol are available from the Canada (Central) and Canada West (Calgary) Regions.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/access-openai-gpt-models-on-amazon-bedrock-from-canada-with-cross-region-inference/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-20T16:42:53.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-22T15:10:54.379Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E6",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "In this post, we walk through the GPT-5.6, GPT-6, and GPT-6.1 models available from Canada and the cross-Region inference profiles that serve them.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/access-openai-gpt-models-on-amazon-bedrock-from-canada-with-cross-region-inference/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-20T16:42:53.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-22T15:10:54.379Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E7",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "With Amazon Bedrock, you can access three families of OpenAI models in Canada through cross-Region inference.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/access-openai-gpt-models-on-amazon-bedrock-from-canada-with-cross-region-inference/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-20T16:42:53.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-22T15:10:54.379Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E8",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "These models are available through the OpenAI Responses API, the OpenAI Chat Completions API, and the Amazon Bedrock Converse API on the bedrock-runtime endpoint.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/access-openai-gpt-models-on-amazon-bedrock-from-canada-with-cross-region-inference/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-20T16:42:53.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-22T15:10:54.379Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E9",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Open the console, choose Canada (Central) or Canada West (Calgary) as your Region, choose Cross-Region inference under Inference , and review the available profiles.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/access-openai-gpt-models-on-amazon-bedrock-from-canada-with-cross-region-inference/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-20T16:42:53.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-22T15:10:54.379Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E10",
        "kind": "body",
