      },
      {
        "id": "E11",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "GPT-5.6, GPT-6, and GPT-6.1 support three access paths on the bedrock-runtime endpoint: the OpenAI Responses API, the OpenAI Chat Completions API, and the Amazon Bedrock Converse API.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/access-openai-gpt-models-on-amazon-bedrock-from-canada-with-cross-region-inference/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
